  "verbalization": "The visible evidence suggests a potential relationship between Npc137816 and Ectonucleotide pyrophosphatase/phosphodiesterase family member 6, mediated through Isopentenyl-diphosphate Delta-isomerase. This pathway involves Npc137816 targeting Isopentenyl-diphosphate Delta-isomerase, which in turn targets Euphoscopin A, and Euphoscopin A further targets Ectonucleotide pyrophosphatase/phosphodiesterase family member 6. The integration of these targets indicates a hierarchical interaction where Npc137816 may influence the activity of Isopentenyl-diphosphate Delta-isomerase, which then modulates Euphoscopin A, ultimately affecting the expression or function of the Ectonucleotide pyrophosphatase/phosphodiesterase family member 6. The evidence supports a chain of targets that links Npc137816 to the enzyme of interest, though the exact mechanism of interaction remains to be fully elucidated.",
